   "title": "0.4 — Textbooks, materials & tools|||0.4 — Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ",
   "slug": "ecb101-flm-0-4-giao-trinh",
   "type": "DOCUMENT",
   "isFreePreview": true,
   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECB101 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbooks: <strong>American Cultural Studies - An introduction to American Culture (student's book)</strong>; <strong>British Culture - An introduction (student's book)</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13843 · Decision 1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 12/12/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECB101 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>American Cultural Studies - An introduction to American Culture (student's book)</strong>; <strong>British Culture - An introduction (student's book)</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13843 · QĐ 1402/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 12/12/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>American Cultural Studies - An introduction to American Culture (student's book)</strong></td><td>Neil Campbell and Alasdair Kean</td><td>Routledge</td><td>2016</td><td>4th</td><td><code>9781138833142</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>British Culture - An introduction (student's book)</strong></td><td>David P. Christopher</td><td>Routledge</td><td>2015</td><td>3rd</td><td><code>9780415810852</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Companion websites:<br><a href=\"https://routledgetextbooks.com/textbooks/9780415810852/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://routledgetextbooks.com/textbooks/9780415810852/</a><br><a href=\"https://routledgetextbooks.com/textbooks/9781138833142/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://routledgetextbooks.com/textbooks/9781138833142/</a></strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Multimedia resources</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>See detail in Schedule (Student Materials)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Digital technology tools (e.g. AI) for self-study, searching &amp; synthesizing information, visual presentation &amp; design, etc.</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>As guided by lecturer based on most relevant tools available</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>- Textbooks<br>- Multimedia resources<br>- Search engines<br>- Writing and grammar check tools<br>- Digital technology tools to assist learning, information search, and document synthesis<br>- APA Style Guide (<a href=\"https://apastyle.apa.org/style-grammar-guidelines/references/examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://apastyle.apa.org/style-grammar-guidelines/references/examples</a>)</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>- Textbooks<br>- Multimedia resources<br>- Search engines<br>- Writing and grammar check tools<br>- Digital technology tools to assist learning, information search, and document synthesis<br>- APA Style Guide (<a href=\"https://apastyle.apa.org/style-grammar-guidelines/references/examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://apastyle.apa.org/style-grammar-guidelines/references/examples</a>)</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13843\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13843</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13843\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13843</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
